#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1826
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "Which ship system upgrade category are you wondering about?"
msgstr "Which ship system upgrade category are you wondering about?"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1830
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "beam"
msgstr "beam"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1834
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Beam upgrades refer to the beam weapons systems. They might include "
"additional beam mounts, longer range, faster recharge or cycle times, "
"increased damage, wider beam firing arcs or faster beam turret rotation "
"speed."
msgstr "Beam upgrades refer to the beam weapons systems. They might include additional beam mounts, longer range, faster recharge or cycle times, increased damage, wider beam firing arcs or faster beam turret rotation speed."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1840
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1856
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1872
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1888
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1904
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1920
#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1936
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "Back to ship upgrade category explanation list"
msgstr "Back to ship upgrade category explanation list"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1846
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "missiles"
msgstr "missiles"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1850
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Missile upgrades refer to aspects of the missile weapons systems. They might "
"include additional tubes, faster tube load times, increased tube size, "
"additional missile types or additional missile storage capacity."
msgstr "Missile upgrades refer to aspects of the missile weapons systems. They might include additional tubes, faster tube load times, increased tube size, additional missile types or additional missile storage capacity."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1862
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "shield"
msgstr "shield"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1866
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Shield upgrades refer to the protective energy shields around your ship. "
"They might include increased charge capacity (overall strength) for the "
"front, rear or both shield arcs or the addition of a shield arc."
msgstr "Shield upgrades refer to the protective energy shields around your ship. They might include increased charge capacity (overall strength) for the front, rear or both shield arcs or the addition of a shield arc."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1878
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "hull"
msgstr "hull"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1882
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Hull upgrades refer to strengthening the ship hull to withstand more damage "
"in the form of armor plating or structural bolstering."
msgstr "Hull upgrades refer to strengthening the ship hull to withstand more damage in the form of armour plating or structural bolstering."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1894
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "impulse"
msgstr "impulse"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1898
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Impulse upgrades refer to changes related to the impulse engines. They might "
"include improving the top speed or acceleration (forward, reverse or both), "
"maneuvering speed or combat maneuver (boost, which is moving forward, or "
"strafe, which is sideways motion or both)."
msgstr "Impulse upgrades refer to changes related to the impulse engines. They might include improving the top speed or acceleration (forward, reverse or both), manoeuvring speed or combat manoeuvre (boost, which is moving forward, or strafe, which is sideways motion or both)."

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1910
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "ftl"
msgstr "ftl"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1914
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"FTL (short for faster than light) upgrades refer to warp drive or jump drive "
"enhancements. They might include the addition of an ftl drive, a change in "
"the range of the jump drive or an increase in the top speed of the warp drive"
msgstr "FTL (short for faster than light) upgrades refer to warp drive or jump drive enhancements. They might include the addition of an ftl drive, a change in the range of the jump drive or an increase in the top speed of the warp drive"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1926
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid "sensors"
msgstr "sensors"

#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:1930
msgctxt "dockingServicesStatus-comms"
msgid ""
"Sensor upgrades refer to the ship's ability to detect other objects. They "
"might include increased long range sensors, increased short range sensors, "
"automated proximity scanners for ships or improved range for automated "
"proximity scanners."
msgstr "Sensor upgrades refer to the ship's ability to detect other objects. They might include increased long range sensors, increased short range sensors, automated proximity scanners for ships or improved range for automated proximity scanners."

