#: scripts/comms_scenario_utility.lua:5838
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid ""
"A normal supply drop delivery is loaded onto a standard freighter and sent "
"to the specified destination. Delivered by jump ship means it gets there "
"quicker if it's farther away because the freighter is equipped with a jump "
"drive. The flinger launches the supply drop using the station's flinger. The "
"supply drop arrives quickly, but the flinger's not as accurate as a "
"freighter."
msgstr "A normal supply drop delivery is loaded onto a standard freighter and sent to the specified destination. Delivered by jump ship means it gets there quicker if it's farther away because the freighter is equipped with a jump drive. The flinger launches the supply drop using the station's flinger. The supply drop arrives quickly, but the flinger's not as accurate as a freighter."

